 "nodes": {
  "-810109038": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So… this is your choice for a bodyguard? She looks more like a street brawler than a professional.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "837959570": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Phoenix",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "And you must be the fashion queen. Figures. You look like money wrapped in perfume.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1269383137": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Hmph. At least I know how to dress for the occasion.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1828003833": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Phoenix",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Yeah? Well, I fight better than I dress. That’s what matters.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "onStart": [
    {
     "kind": "setActive",
     "type": "InstructionGameObjectSetActive",
     "title": "Set Active PhoenixCharlotteEntrancePeek (1) to True",
     "fields": {
      "m_Active": {
       "kind": "value",
       "value": true
      },
      "m_GameObject": {
       "kind": "object",
       "name": "PhoenixCharlotteEntrancePeek (1)",
       "of": "GetGameObjectInstance",
       "path": "4_CG_Manager-Sexy_Three/PhoenixCharlotteEntrancePeek (1)"
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "-1695512943": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Well. Appearances are not everything, I suppose. Strength is what counts in this line of work.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
   "onStart": [
    {
     "kind": "setActive",
     "type": "InstructionGameObjectSetActive",
     "title": "Set Active PhoenixCharlotteEntrancePeek (2) to True",
     "fields": {
      "m_Active": {
       "kind": "value",
       "value": true
      },
      "m_GameObject": {
       "kind": "object",
       "name": "PhoenixCharlotteEntrancePeek (2)",
       "of": "GetGameObjectInstance",
       "path": "4_CG_Manager-Sexy_Three/PhoenixCharlotteEntrancePeek (2)"
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "1646194076": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Phoenix",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Heh. Thought so.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2052541948": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "…Very well. I will give you a chance. Do not make me regret this.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1523616711": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Phoenix",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Good. I was getting bored anyway.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-598634502": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Hmph. Just remember, this is a job, not a game.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1757101928": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Phoenix",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Sure. But trust me, anyone who tries something on you won’t try it twice.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2111416615": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Charlotte",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Well....",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
